      "id": "claim_6005978daf6740829b6fe16c74413b8f",
      "statement": "dashboard-api is a Cloudflare Worker serving 8 contracted GET envelope routes — /portfolio, /allocations, /brief, /performance, /kpis/live, /nav-series, /benchmarks, /ledger — plus /healthz (liveness) and /v1/tables/:table (generic PostgREST proxy). Two folds eliminate standalone routes: /book-date folds into /portfolio as book_as_of, and /valuations folds into /allocations as per-row mark fields.",
