      "statement": "The digithings-stack worker folds dashboard-api under the canonical path prefix /dashboard-api/*. The fold uses runIsolated('dashboard-api', ...) for lazy import + per-group fault isolation: import failure or handler failure degrades only /dashboard-api/* paths (503), every other route group keeps serving. The prefix is stripped and the request forwarded to dashboardApi.fetch(), keeping responses byte-identical to the standalone worker.",
